Dialogue: 15,0:00:16.37,0:00:18.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ikuo... C-Could this be...
Dialogue: 15,0:00:18.91,0:00:21.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Way to go! It's a pure deer hoof!
Dialogue: 15,0:00:21.45,0:00:23.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, for real?!
Dialogue: 15,0:00:23.50,0:00:24.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Gimme! Please!
Dialogue: 15,0:00:24.87,0:00:27.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What? No way.
Dialogue: 15,0:00:27.00,0:00:29.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It was my deer that beat the poacher.
Dialogue: 15,0:00:29.25,0:00:32.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Dude... This is why you're not popular with girls.
Dialogue: 15,0:00:33.59,0:00:36.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did you think a guy raising deer in secret like this
Dialogue: 15,0:00:36.26,0:00:38.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,had a shot at being popular in the first place?
Dialogue: 15,0:00:38.81,0:00:41.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,When you groomed your deer in class the other day,
Dialogue: 15,0:00:41.56,0:00:43.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,the girls were seriously creeped out.
Dialogue: 15,0:00:43.94,0:00:46.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I keep telling you to play on mute.
Dialogue: 15,0:00:46.90,0:00:49.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You've become a hot topic among \Nthe girls, and not in a good way.
Dialogue: 15,0:00:49.57,0:00:53.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, deer do sound a little erotic when they purr.
Dialogue: 15,0:00:53.49,0:00:55.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't blame them for misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 15,0:00:55.82,0:00:57.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 15,0:00:57.03,0:01:01.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you can create all sorts \Nof items with a pure deer hoof.
Dialogue: 15,0:01:01.08,0:01:04.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna give one to my deer and let\N its happy face soothe my weary heart!
Dialogue: 15,0:01:04.58,0:01:08.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving you mine, and that's final.
Dialogue: 15,0:01:09.46,0:01:12.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You sure seem to be having \Na good time here, of all places.
Dialogue: 15,0:01:15.59,0:01:16.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Miyamae?
Dialogue: 15,0:01:17.47,0:01:22.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you the guys that people say \Nare secretly raising deer at school?
Dialogue: 15,0:01:22.22,0:01:24.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 15,0:01:24.23,0:01:25.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 15,0:01:26.73,0:01:31.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If you think we're playing a porn game, \Nyou're mistaken.
Dialogue: 15,0:01:31.02,0:01:31.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 15,0:01:31.98,0:01:36.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Love Deer is a wholesome, all-ages game!
Dialogue: 15,0:01:36.49,0:01:37.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 15,0:01:38.16,0:01:40.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are there any items you want?
Dialogue: 15,0:01:40.74,0:01:44.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wait... Do you want my pure deer hoof?
Dialogue: 15,0:01:48.71,0:01:51.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Miyamae Tooru from Class 3-A.
Dialogue: 15,0:01:51.00,0:01:54.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Would you trade items with me?
Dialogue: 15,0:03:28.39,0:03:29.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 15,0:03:29.81,0:03:31.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is that the God of Deer or what?!
Dialogue: 15,0:03:31.60,0:03:33.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How did you level it up so much?!
Dialogue: 15,0:03:33.81,0:03:37.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've been playing this game since it came out.
Dialogue: 15,0:03:38.40,0:03:40.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Did you guys pick it up recently?
Dialogue: 15,0:03:40.32,0:03:44.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We've been playing it a lot since it came out, too.
Dialogue: 15,0:03:44.95,0:03:47.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just how much did she play\N to raise such a bulky deer?
Dialogue: 15,0:03:50.33,0:03:52.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Before I send you one of my items,
Dialogue: 15,0:03:52.33,0:03:54.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,show me your deer's stat sheet.
Dialogue: 15,0:04:03.51,0:04:05.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It specializes in night battles, huh?
Dialogue: 15,0:04:05.47,0:04:06.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 15,0:04:06.97,0:04:09.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Deer are nocturnal creatures, after all.
Dialogue: 15,0:04:09.39,0:04:12.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't even know there was a shortcut like that.
Dialogue: 15,0:04:12.19,0:04:14.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tooru? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 15,0:04:14.81,0:04:16.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's head straight to the club room.
Dialogue: 15,0:04:16.94,0:04:17.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 15,0:04:17.82,0:04:19.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shouichi and Ikuo{-kun}?
Dialogue: 15,0:04:19.69,0:04:21.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Araki{-kun}, too?
Dialogue: 15,0:04:21.07,0:04:22.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 15,0:04:22.36,0:04:23.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Moe{-nee}.
Dialogue: 15,0:04:23.49,0:04:24.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 15,0:04:24.78,0:04:28.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, you guys are like insects, \Nhiding away under here to play games.
Dialogue: 15,0:04:28.28,0:04:29.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you get enough at home?
Dialogue: 15,0:04:29.62,0:04:32.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault, okay?
Dialogue: 15,0:04:32.00,0:04:35.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you're Shouichi{-kun}?
Dialogue: 15,0:04:35.00,0:04:37.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're infamous for playing games all day.
Dialogue: 15,0:04:37.50,0:04:38.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 15,0:04:38.71,0:04:41.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A-An absolute babe just called \Nme by name right off the bat!
Dialogue: 15,0:04:41.96,0:04:44.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's go get you \Nmeasured in the club room.
Dialogue: 15,0:04:44.38,0:04:48.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, I didn't say I would model for you yet.
Dialogue: 15,0:04:48.76,0:04:51.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I asked you to trade, but I've gotta go.
Dialogue: 15,0:04:51.39,0:04:54.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine. We can complete \Nthe trade next time we meet.
Dialogue: 15,0:04:54.39,0:04:57.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll give you an item in return then. I promise.
Dialogue: 15,0:04:58.69,0:04:59.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 15,0:04:59.65,0:05:01.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 15,0:04:59.65,0:05:01.78,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's go.
Dialogue: 15,0:05:17.00,0:05:18.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Instakilled?
Dialogue: 15,0:05:20.21,0:05:23.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Guess it's not a nightmare stage for nothing.
Dialogue: 15,0:05:23.05,0:05:26.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Would it be a piece of cake for Miyamae{-senpai}'s deer?
Dialogue: 15,0:05:26.68,0:05:29.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, so you're Shouichi{-kun}?
Dialogue: 15,0:05:30.01,0:05:32.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She seemed so cool.
Dialogue: 15,0:05:32.52,0:05:34.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If she were my sister,
Dialogue: 15,0:05:34.31,0:05:37.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I bet we wouldn't fight over \Nthe bathroom every morning.
Dialogue: 15,0:05:38.06,0:05:41.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All right! I'm gonna raise \Nan even more amazing deer!
Dialogue: 15,0:05:41.65,0:05:45.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I'm gonna stand \Nshoulder-to-shoulder with her as a gamer!
Dialogue: 15,0:05:49.45,0:05:55.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Man, I never realized that Miyamae, \Nan honor student, was such a hardcore gamer.
Dialogue: 15,0:05:55.08,0:05:58.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Should you really have given her that item, though?
Dialogue: 15,0:05:58.17,0:05:59.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 15,0:05:59.33,0:06:04.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,In return, we can have her join \Nour party and pick her brain for info.
Dialogue: 15,0:06:04.67,0:06:09.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Besides, I can't just let her walk away\N after showing off that deer of hers.
Dialogue: 15,0:06:09.05,0:06:11.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna show her my proud gamer spirit.
Dialogue: 15,0:06:15.27,0:06:17.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Miyamae{-senpai}?
Dialogue: 15,0:06:21.81,0:06:23.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's up?
Dialogue: 15,0:06:23.82,0:06:27.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't sleep with my indoor shoes on.
Dialogue: 15,0:06:27.57,0:06:30.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 15,0:06:30.03,0:06:32.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I brought an item to give you.
Dialogue: 15,0:06:32.07,0:06:34.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's pick up where we left off yesterday.
Dialogue: 15,0:06:34.08,0:06:35.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,S-Sure!
Dialogue: 15,0:06:40.50,0:06:42.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Can we place an order?
Dialogue: 15,0:06:42.34,0:06:46.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Four oolong teas, a takoyaki mystery box,
Dialogue: 15,0:06:46.59,0:06:48.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,and... what else?
Dialogue: 15,0:06:48.09,0:06:50.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How did we end up at a karaoke place?
Dialogue: 15,0:06:50.47,0:06:54.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,When I said I wanted to head \Nsomewhere else to trade with Miyamae{-senpai},
Dialogue: 15,0:06:54.43,0:06:55.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Araki{-san} suggested this!
Dialogue: 15,0:06:56.52,0:06:58.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll start, then.
Dialogue: 15,0:06:59.98,0:07:01.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 15,0:07:01.19,0:07:03.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're here to trade, but she's singing.
Dialogue: 15,0:07:03.40,0:07:05.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, this {\i1}is{\i0} a karaoke place.
Dialogue: 15,0:07:05.44,0:07:07.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 15,0:07:07.36,0:07:11.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We only know songs from \Nanime and game soundtracks!
Dialogue: 15,0:07:11.24,0:07:13.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, and tokusatsu songs are off-limits, okay?
Dialogue: 15,0:07:13.49,0:07:15.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 15,0:07:16.74,0:07:17.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That song...
Dialogue: 15,0:07:18.25,0:07:19.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Locust Mask?!
Dialogue: 15,0:07:21.87,0:07:22.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 15,0:07:23.88,0:07:27.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And it's from Crimson Santa?!
Dialogue: 15,0:07:27.80,0:07:32.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tooru said she was gonna go hand over\N the gift she made for your brother.
Dialogue: 15,0:07:32.43,0:07:35.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She must've stayed up really late making it.
Dialogue: 15,0:07:35.47,0:07:37.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She looked so drowsy all day.
Dialogue: 15,0:07:37.31,0:07:38.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 15,0:07:40.14,0:07:42.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Please call me once you've decided on your order.
Dialogue: 15,0:07:50.19,0:07:52.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't believe Miss Santa dropped by!
Dialogue: 15,0:07:52.99,0:07:56.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wanna talk to her, but I'm working in secret...
Dialogue: 15,0:07:56.28,0:07:57.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is making me so nervous!
Dialogue: 15,0:07:57.91,0:07:59.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But also really excited!
Dialogue: 15,0:08:10.17,0:08:11.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 15,0:08:11.09,0:08:13.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's time to start trading.
Dialogue: 15,0:08:14.68,0:08:16.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I need to take five first.
Dialogue: 15,0:08:18.18,0:08:19.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 15,0:08:37.20,0:08:39.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Do you like pudding à la mode, Shouichi{-kun}?
Dialogue: 15,0:08:41.12,0:08:43.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I actually have a real sweet tooth.
Dialogue: 15,0:08:43.58,0:08:45.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Could you give me a bite?
Dialogue: 15,0:08:47.08,0:08:49.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Miyamae{-senpai}, that'd be an indirect ki—
Dialogue: 15,0:08:49.96,0:08:51.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What is it, Nanasaki{-kun}?
Dialogue: 15,0:08:51.71,0:08:55.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we haven't touched this bowl.
Dialogue: 15,0:08:55.34,0:08:57.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks. I'll have some.
Dialogue: 15,0:09:02.35,0:09:06.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you must've been bored \Nwith me hogging the mic, right?
Dialogue: 15,0:09:06.98,0:09:08.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I haven't done karaoke in ages, so I just...
Dialogue: 15,0:09:08.73,0:09:10.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No, we weren't bored!
Dialogue: 15,0:09:10.82,0:09:13.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You were singing anime songs we knew, \Nso we could join in, too.
Dialogue: 15,0:09:13.99,0:09:15.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 15,0:09:15.28,0:09:15.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 15,0:09:18.12,0:09:19.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 15,0:09:19.95,0:09:21.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 15,0:09:24.21,0:09:26.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I made you equipment suited for night battles.
Dialogue: 15,0:09:26.79,0:09:28.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It increases your enemy detection rates, too.
Dialogue: 15,0:09:28.75,0:09:30.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 15,0:09:30.38,0:09:33.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is a perfect fit for my deer's skills!
Dialogue: 15,0:09:33.71,0:09:35.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 15,0:09:35.17,0:09:37.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Miyamae, do you like multiplayer\N games or something?
Dialogue: 15,0:09:37.64,0:09:40.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 15,0:09:40.26,0:09:44.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, a night-vision scope \Nis something that shines in PvP.
Dialogue: 15,0:09:44.73,0:09:45.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 15,0:09:45.98,0:09:49.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The games I like tend to have multiplayer elements.
Dialogue: 15,0:09:49.02,0:09:52.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really? We love multiplayer games, too.
Dialogue: 15,0:09:52.19,0:09:56.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, but it seems the games \NI used to play were all kinda weird.
Dialogue: 15,0:09:57.32,0:10:01.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, how about we all play \NMiliBun together when it comes out?
Dialogue: 15,0:10:01.49,0:10:05.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The new iteration in a franchise \Nthat's had a lot of longtime die-hard fans?
Dialogue: 15,0:10:05.29,0:10:08.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Would you like to give it a try, Miyamae{-senpai}?
Dialogue: 15,0:10:09.04,0:10:11.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I've already pre-ordered it!
Dialogue: 15,0:10:48.58,0:10:51.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! Everybody created \Ntheir characters at home, right?
Dialogue: 15,0:10:51.58,0:10:55.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's really fun when you start \Nplaying a game in a group.
Dialogue: 15,0:10:55.00,0:10:57.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I had a hard time resisting \Nthe urge to play last night.
Dialogue: 15,0:10:59.43,0:11:00.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,"Bear"?
Dialogue: 15,0:11:00.38,0:11:02.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who's this naked bear?
Dialogue: 15,0:11:02.34,0:11:03.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 15,0:11:03.80,0:11:06.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you have any equipment?
Dialogue: 15,0:11:06.35,0:11:10.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My initial stats are much higher instead. \NThat's the advantage the bear race has.
Dialogue: 15,0:11:10.77,0:11:13.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who's this bunny in a military uniform?
Dialogue: 15,0:11:13.73,0:11:15.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's me.
Dialogue: 15,0:11:15.07,0:11:19.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That slender build fits you to a T.
Dialogue: 15,0:11:19.11,0:11:21.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You think?
Dialogue: 15,0:11:21.24,0:11:22.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 15,0:11:24.49,0:11:27.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, is everyone okay \Nwith starting in the forest stage?
Dialogue: 15,0:11:29.87,0:11:32.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where are you guys?
Dialogue: 15,0:11:32.33,0:11:34.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't see anyone.
Dialogue: 15,0:11:34.46,0:11:37.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm walking across the bridge.
Dialogue: 15,0:11:37.00,0:11:39.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We can't even meet our own party, \Nlet alone enemies?
Dialogue: 15,0:11:39.67,0:11:41.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,First stages should be much more straightforward.
Dialogue: 15,0:11:41.88,0:11:44.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you guys?
Dialogue: 15,0:11:44.26,0:11:45.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O-Oh boy!
Dialogue: 15,0:11:46.31,0:11:46.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,My bunny...
Dialogue: 15,0:11:46.76,0:11:47.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Araki{-kun}?
Dialogue: 15,0:11:47.77,0:11:49.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Quit pushing me.
Dialogue: 15,0:11:49.02,0:11:50.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll fall off the bridge!
Dialogue: 15,0:11:50.52,0:11:53.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Come on!
Dialogue: 15,0:11:59.78,0:12:02.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Jeez! Adjust your camera angle!
Dialogue: 15,0:12:02.49,0:12:04.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why'd I die?
Dialogue: 15,0:12:04.78,0:12:07.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You didn't even realize you died? What are you—
Dialogue: 15,0:12:07.28,0:12:08.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 15,0:12:08.79,0:12:11.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Crap! I suddenly died!
Dialogue: 15,0:12:11.41,0:12:14.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Was that you just now, Shouichi?
Dialogue: 15,0:12:24.22,0:12:26.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 15,0:12:29.93,0:12:32.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's amazing!
Dialogue: 15,0:12:32.02,0:12:35.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Right? My recommendation \Nwas on the money, right?!
Dialogue: 15,0:12:35.81,0:12:39.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Doesn't your character have an \Nenemy detection skill, Miyamae{-senpai}?
Dialogue: 15,0:12:39.69,0:12:41.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Er...
Dialogue: 15,0:12:42.70,0:12:45.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry. That was my character.
Dialogue: 15,0:12:45.49,0:12:50.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Uh... Did you not like the game?
Dialogue: 15,0:12:51.41,0:12:53.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 15,0:12:53.66,0:12:55.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 15,0:12:57.54,0:13:00.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I envy you, Tooru. \NHow are you so good at sports, too?
Dialogue: 15,0:13:00.96,0:13:03.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You probably could've made it\N as a starter on any of our teams.
Dialogue: 15,0:13:03.80,0:13:06.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I want to play games, so no clubs for me.
Dialogue: 15,0:13:06.30,0:13:10.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How's the game you've been playing \Nwith Shouichi and the guys since last week?
Dialogue: 15,0:13:10.06,0:13:14.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Playing as a group brings back \Nmemories of middle school, I guess?
Dialogue: 15,0:13:14.31,0:13:16.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'd been playing by myself for ages.
Dialogue: 15,0:13:16.81,0:13:20.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You gotta make precious memories, right?
Dialogue: 15,0:13:20.32,0:13:24.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So model for me at Comic Market,\Nas a high school memory.
Dialogue: 15,0:13:24.11,0:13:26.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The game we're playing right now is MiliBun.
Dialogue: 15,0:13:26.74,0:13:28.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 15,0:13:28.49,0:13:32.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I pre-ordered it after you told \Nme it had cute characters.
Dialogue: 15,0:13:32.91,0:13:36.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to find people to play it with.
Dialogue: 15,0:13:36.46,0:13:38.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Life is strange, huh?
Dialogue: 15,0:13:38.46,0:13:44.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shouichi{-kun} said the same thing as Shiori, \Nthat the bunny protagonist fits me to a T.
Dialogue: 15,0:13:44.47,0:13:46.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, that settles it!
Dialogue: 15,0:13:46.34,0:13:49.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be a costume designer, \Nand you'll be a mascot!
Dialogue: 15,0:13:49.22,0:13:51.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Cosplay as a bunny, and we'll be stars overnight!
Dialogue: 15,0:13:51.93,0:13:56.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,ComiMa sounds fun, but I don't want \Npeople I know to see me cosplay.
Dialogue: 15,0:13:56.81,0:13:58.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You know people who'll show up there?
Dialogue: 15,0:13:59.15,0:13:59.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 15,0:14:00.36,0:14:01.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 15,0:14:01.44,0:14:04.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, have you lost weight, Tomoe?
Dialogue: 15,0:14:05.19,0:14:06.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 15,0:14:06.49,0:14:08.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You can tell?
Dialogue: 15,0:14:16.75,0:14:17.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 15,0:14:17.83,0:14:19.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Nanasaki{-kun}!
Dialogue: 15,0:14:22.84,0:14:24.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What item did you get?
Dialogue: 15,0:14:24.88,0:14:26.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A bunny ring.
Dialogue: 15,0:14:26.55,0:14:30.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It raises critical hit and evasion rates by 30% each.
Dialogue: 15,0:14:30.39,0:14:32.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Lucky.
Dialogue: 15,0:14:32.10,0:14:33.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's a ring for tanks, huh?
Dialogue: 15,0:14:33.89,0:14:35.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Not for me, then.
Dialogue: 15,0:14:35.93,0:14:38.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You use this, Miyamae{-senpai}.
Dialogue: 15,0:14:38.06,0:14:39.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Me?
Dialogue: 15,0:14:39.73,0:14:43.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Equipping it on your character \Nwould be most effective.
Dialogue: 15,0:14:43.32,0:14:44.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 15,0:14:44.65,0:14:46.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll get us lots of instakills.
Dialogue: 15,0:14:47.24,0:14:51.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you wanted a bunny item, too?
Dialogue: 15,0:14:51.12,0:14:52.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry I didn't realize.
Dialogue: 15,0:14:52.91,0:14:56.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. It's not like that.
Dialogue: 15,0:14:56.33,0:14:57.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 15,0:15:00.04,0:15:00.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 15,0:15:01.33,0:15:03.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is that MiliBun merch?
Dialogue: 15,0:15:03.54,0:15:06.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's a bunny strap I made recently.
Dialogue: 15,0:15:06.42,0:15:08.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is this good enough for you?
Dialogue: 15,0:15:09.01,0:15:11.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You made that?!
Dialogue: 15,0:15:11.05,0:15:13.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I love my character.
Dialogue: 15,0:15:13.60,0:15:14.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Gimme that—
Dialogue: 15,0:15:14.81,0:15:16.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll think of it as you and take good care of it!
Dialogue: 15,0:15:16.81,0:15:18.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 15,0:15:46.34,0:15:48.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,G-Good for you, Shouichi.
Dialogue: 15,0:15:49.21,0:15:50.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Araki{-san}...
Dialogue: 15,0:15:50.26,0:15:54.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Doesn't the limited-time crane game to\N commemorate MiliBun's release come in today?
Dialogue: 15,0:15:54.09,0:15:55.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 15,0:15:55.10,0:15:58.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're headed straight to the arcade \Nonce sixth period ends!
Dialogue: 15,0:16:00.10,0:16:03.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I don't see the regulars from other schools here.
Dialogue: 15,0:16:03.10,0:16:04.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get right to it.
Dialogue: 15,0:16:25.08,0:16:27.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This arm's set way too loose!
Dialogue: 15,0:16:30.09,0:16:30.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You can have this.
Dialogue: 15,0:16:30.84,0:16:32.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 15,0:16:32.97,0:16:35.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He's gonna keep trying until\N he gets that bunny figure.
Dialogue: 15,0:16:35.93,0:16:38.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Would you like some bandages, Miyamae{-senpai}?
Dialogue: 15,0:16:44.77,0:16:47.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you interested in GusGal?
Dialogue: 15,0:16:47.77,0:16:52.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I used to play it with \Npeople back in middle school.
Dialogue: 15,0:16:52.15,0:16:54.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know there were arcades that still had it.
Dialogue: 15,0:16:54.53,0:16:57.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There's a PvP event held here every week.
Dialogue: 15,0:16:57.82,0:17:00.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Famous players will show up later at night.
Dialogue: 15,0:17:00.95,0:17:01.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 15,0:17:02.29,0:17:04.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But I think I'm done with competitive gaming.
Dialogue: 15,0:17:04.83,0:17:08.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I played too much during my third year\N of middle school and regretted it.
Dialogue: 15,0:17:08.84,0:17:10.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There aren't many people around right now,
Dialogue: 15,0:17:10.80,0:17:13.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,so how about we play a little co-op?
Dialogue: 15,0:17:17.64,0:17:19.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 15,0:17:19.14,0:17:21.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It has been a while.
Dialogue: 15,0:17:34.32,0:17:37.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is your targeting a little rusty?
Dialogue: 15,0:17:37.03,0:17:40.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I-It's okay. I'll get used to it soon.
Dialogue: 15,0:17:40.16,0:17:42.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll back you up, so we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 15,0:17:42.83,0:17:44.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 15,0:17:50.38,0:17:52.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They're grade schoolers, so we'll be fine...
Dialogue: 15,0:17:52.96,0:17:53.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think?
Dialogue: 15,0:18:06.02,0:18:07.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,These guys!
Dialogue: 15,0:18:07.06,0:18:09.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A couple playing GusGal? You're an eyesore!
Dialogue: 15,0:18:10.27,0:18:11.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Couple?!
Dialogue: 15,0:18:13.98,0:18:16.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Watch in tears as your girlfriend gets devoured.
Dialogue: 15,0:18:17.57,0:18:19.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Stay put, Shouichi{-kun}.
Dialogue: 15,0:18:27.58,0:18:30.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Quit running around, you stupid bunny!
Dialogue: 15,0:18:31.54,0:18:33.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This game of tag is over!
Dialogue: 15,0:18:34.76,0:18:36.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's gonna take out his teammate, too?!
Dialogue: 15,0:18:36.51,0:18:38.22,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Adios, Wataru.
Dialogue: 15,0:18:38.22,0:18:39.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You sold me out?
Dialogue: 15,0:18:39.26,0:18:41.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Takeshi!
Dialogue: 15,0:18:44.77,0:18:46.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Shouichi{-kun}.
Dialogue: 15,0:18:47.77,0:18:49.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She kicked him and her boyfriend?!
Dialogue: 15,0:18:58.78,0:19:00.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We lost?
Dialogue: 15,0:19:00.61,0:19:02.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wataru! One more time!
Dialogue: 15,0:19:20.18,0:19:23.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You held back because she's a girl, right?
Dialogue: 15,0:19:23.80,0:19:26.52,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here, as thanks.
Dialogue: 15,0:19:28.18,0:19:30.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer a robot.
Dialogue: 15,0:19:31.06,0:19:33.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Take a look at the crane game over there.
Dialogue: 15,0:19:33.69,0:19:37.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is all the rage among high schoolers right now.
Dialogue: 15,0:19:37.69,0:19:39.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Show it off to the girls in class.
Dialogue: 15,0:19:39.95,0:19:42.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We won't lose next time!
Dialogue: 15,0:19:42.16,0:19:43.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Wataru!
Dialogue: 15,0:19:43.32,0:19:44.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 15,0:19:44.20,0:19:45.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, you traitor!
Dialogue: 15,0:19:45.91,0:19:47.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, Miyamae{-senpai}.
Dialogue: 15,0:19:47.16,0:19:49.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Those poor kids were only grade schoolers.
Dialogue: 15,0:19:49.29,0:19:53.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I went through much worse \Nwhen I was in grade school.
Dialogue: 15,0:19:53.13,0:19:56.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Not holding back is all well and good, \Nbut kicking dead players is overkill.
Dialogue: 15,0:19:56.67,0:19:57.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 15,0:19:57.67,0:19:59.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Keep doing that,
Dialogue: 15,0:19:59.63,0:20:02.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,and eventually, no one will play with you anymore.
Dialogue: 15,0:20:03.89,0:20:06.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I-I know that.
Dialogue: 15,0:20:06.10,0:20:11.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry. I gave away the strap you gave me.
Dialogue: 15,0:20:12.89,0:20:15.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 15,0:20:15.23,0:20:16.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 15,0:20:18.61,0:20:22.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Man, I said I'd back you up, \Nbut I was completely useless.
Dialogue: 15,0:20:23.03,0:20:25.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, that was an amazing headshot!
Dialogue: 15,0:20:31.25,0:20:32.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 15,0:20:32.91,0:20:38.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thinking back to the moment I nailed \Nthat headshot made my heart race.
Dialogue: 15,0:20:38.13,0:20:39.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 15,0:20:39.76,0:20:41.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You turned beet red.
Dialogue: 15,0:20:42.42,0:20:45.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm happy I played GusGal after so long and won.
Dialogue: 15,0:20:45.14,0:20:47.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I owe it to you, Shouichi{-kun}.
Dialogue: 15,0:20:47.80,0:20:48.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nah, I didn't...
Dialogue: 15,0:20:48.89,0:20:51.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, I've got a request.
Dialogue: 15,0:20:51.77,0:20:55.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I won't kick dead players anymore,\N so would you be my GusGal partner?
Dialogue: 15,0:20:56.81,0:20:59.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Miyamae{-senpai}?
Dialogue: 15,0:20:59.90,0:21:03.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Now this is a big haul! A big harvest, even!
Dialogue: 15,0:21:04.53,0:21:06.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Shouichi?
Dialogue: 15,0:21:06.36,0:21:10.12,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I played some GusGal with her...
Dialogue: 15,0:21:10.12,0:21:13.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It reminded me of how fun it was.
Dialogue: 15,0:21:13.08,0:21:15.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So I asked him to be my partner.
Dialogue: 15,0:21:15.92,0:21:17.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 15,0:21:17.42,0:21:19.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can't, since my game is too solo-centric.
Dialogue: 15,0:21:19.42,0:21:22.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And I stopped playing GusGal after grade school.
Dialogue: 15,0:21:22.84,0:21:26.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think I can get a lot better with you as my partner.
Dialogue: 15,0:21:27.18,0:21:28.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Will you do it?
Dialogue: 15,0:21:28.14,0:21:30.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,S-Sure, if you're okay with me!
Dialogue: 15,0:21:31.89,0:21:33.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 15,0:21:51.99,0:21:53.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 15,0:21:53.04,0:21:55.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How long are you gonna stay in the bath?
Dialogue: 15,0:21:55.04,0:21:56.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Get out already.
Dialogue: 15,0:21:57.29,0:21:58.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Christ.
Dialogue: 15,0:21:58.75,0:22:00.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 15,0:23:41.02,0:23:42.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Preview time.
Dialogue: 15,0:23:42.73,0:23:46.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Miyamae{-senpai}, were you obsessed with \Nheadshots back in middle school, too?
Dialogue: 15,0:23:46.94,0:23:50.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's an all-important skill \Nthat can instakill opponents.
Dialogue: 15,0:23:50.49,0:23:55.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I bet it'd feel amazing if I could \Nnail headshots like you!
Dialogue: 15,0:23:55.74,0:23:57.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,D-Don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 15,0:23:57.58,0:23:59.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It doesn't feel good or anything.
Dialogue: 15,0:23:59.83,0:24:01.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 15,0:24:01.33,0:24:04.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It felt amazing when you kicked me in the back.
Dialogue: 15,0:24:05.09,0:24:07.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Next time: "Versus."
Dialogue: 15,0:24:07.09,0:24:09.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you a masochist?
Comment: 0,0:24:09.92,0:24:11.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.38,0:02:02.51,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,250)\be1}My heart isn't going anywhere
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.51,0:02:07.27,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,250)\be1}It will always choose you
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.64,0:02:15.61,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,250)\be1}Dashing toward those feelings of love,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.61,0:02:19.41,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,250)\be1}over and over again
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.70,0:02:31.17,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,250)\be1}When I first saw you, everything went into slow-motion
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.17,0:02:43.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,250)\be1}I fell in love with your hair and smile
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.43,0:02:50.81,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,250)\be1}From the voices that echo through the classroom,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.81,0:02:56.19,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,250)\be1}I can hear yours right away
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.94,0:03:00.95,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,250)\be1}I fall in love with you more and more every day
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.95,0:03:03.62,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,250)\be1}I want to tightly grasp your petite hands
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.62,0:03:10.04,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,250)\be1}Your voice glimmers like a flower in the breeze
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.04,0:03:13.00,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,250)\be1}Fleeting but powerful
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.00,0:03:16.09,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,250)\be1}It continues to shine
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.09,0:03:24.80,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,250)\be1}I want to embrace you and never let you go
Comment: 0,0:24:11.92,0:24:13.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.06,0:22:29.53,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\bord5\3c&H000000&\be3\fad(180,300)}I'm a little happy now, but to be honest, I was really scared
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.53,0:22:39.58,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\bord5\3c&H000000&\be3\fad(180,300)}You saw through my weakness, something no one else could see
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.58,0:22:49.34,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\bord5\3c&H000000&\be3\fad(180,300)}After being alone for so long I only get excited when I win
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.34,0:22:58.52,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\bord5\3c&H000000&\be3\fad(180,300)}You can be truly glad if you defeat the obstacles before you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.19,0:23:08.61,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\bord5\3c&H000000&\be3\fad(180,300)}If the Invincible Goddess smiles down on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.61,0:23:13.58,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\bord5\3c&H000000&\be3\fad(180,300)}And if you believe
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.58,0:23:18.46,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\bord5\3c&H000000&\be3\fad(180,300)}That no one is stronger than you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:28.05,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\bord5\3c&H000000&\be3\fad(180,300)}Can you then make your dreams come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.05,0:23:32.30,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\bord5\3c&H000000&\be3\fad(180,300)}Please tell me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.06,0:22:29.53,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\be3\fad(180,300)\1a&HFF&\t(135,180,\1a&H00&)\t(8790,8835,\1a&HFF&)}I'm a little happy now, but to be honest, I was really scared
